{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Famous Artists", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Becoming Famous", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Looking to the Stars > Charlie Chaplin", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Present Perfect Tense vs. The Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "To identify the differences between the Simple Past and the Present Perfect, we can compare the following sentences.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Example</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul>  \t<li>He has studied English for five years. (This means that five years ago he started to study English, and five years after, he continues studying English.) </li> \t<li>He studied English five years ago. (This means that he studied English five years ago, and he finished.)</li>  </ul>   \t\t\t</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Additionally, the Present Perfect needs the verb <span class =\"italic\">to have</span> as well as the past participle of the verb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Examples</span>:<br><span class=\"italic\"><ul>  \t<li> Have you ever wondered? (The past participle for regular verbs is the same Simple Past \u201ced\u201d form e.g. wonder \u2013 wondered.)</li> <li>I've had questions from my readers about this. (The past participle for irregular verbs may vary - e.g. have \u2013 had.)</li> </ul>   \t\t\t</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find a list of verbs and their past participle forms. Memorize as many as you can. For example:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":11,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"                was / were  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Become \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"became \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"become \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Catch                \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"caught               \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"caught\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"               did \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"                       done \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Fly \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"                flew                       \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" flown \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Keep             \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" kept       \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" kept \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Put  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"              put    \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"                    put \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Show\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"                showed        \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"        shown\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Throw                \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"threw                       \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"thrown \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Write                \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"wrote                        \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"written\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "When you use the Present Perfect tense, you think about the past and present together. There is some connection between what happened in the past and now, but you use the Simple Past to talk about something that happened in the past and finished in the past.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Describing Personality and Behavior", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use adjectives and adverbs to describe a person's personality and behavior.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "If you want to be famous, you have to be unique!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You describe personality when you say how a person usually is. It is true most of the time. You use the verb<span class=\"italic\"> to be</span> + adjectives. <br>You describe behavior when you say what a person does or how a person is at a particular time. You use the verb <span class=\"italic\">to be</span> + adjectives or expressions like <span class=\"italic\">you were acting ... </span> or<span class=\"italic\"> you behaved</span>  + adverb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Describing Personality\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Describing Behavior\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"unique</br> attention-grabbing</br> offbeat</br> larger-than-life</br> eccentric</br> imaginative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She was ...  yesterday</br> I/you/he behaved ... + adverb\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "recently ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "happening not long ago", "type": "definition"}, {"con