re it counts. </li></ol>", "time": "14000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn6le06ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "So, if you're thinking about becoming famous, maybe some of these tips will help. Good luck, readers!", "time": "67000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}